<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimates of major South African company results expected next week include the following (all figures cents per share):</p>
<p>DAY--COMPANY------------PERIOD--CONSENSUS----RANGE---------PVS--</p>
<p>WED  Boland		 YR EPS  272.0	    -	     211.0</p>
<p>WED  Boland		 YR DIV  92.0	     -	     77.7</p>
<p>THUR Adcock		 H1 EPS  55.0	   53.6-56.5     47.2</p>
<p>THUR Adcock		 H1 DIV  14.3	   13-15	   12.6</p>
<p>NOTE - An insufficent number of forecasts could be obtained for Boland. The majority of analysts said results were &quot;immaterial&quot; ahead of the group's merger in May with NBS Holdings Ltd which will result in Boland delisting.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
